<title>USA: Reynolds Metals Co Q1 profit summary.</title>
<headline>Reynolds Metals Co Q1 profit summary.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.59     loss	 $0.12</p>
<p> Net profit		43,000   profit	 2,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,662,000		1,675,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  72,872		   63,604</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 revenues include $38 million gainm on sale of assets which added $23 million, or $0.32/shr, to net.</p>
<p>1996 per share after $9 million of preferred dividends.</p>
<p>1996 net includes $15 million, or $0.24/shr, charge for accounting change and $37 million pretax restructuring charge.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
